# What stays out of the build context. The tree is small apart from
# `target/`, which is gigabytes, so this is deliberately a short list:
# the room server's build reads the workspace manifests, `src/`,
# `server/` and `maps/` (the shipped maps are `include_str!`-embedded,
# src/map.rs), and paying a few megabytes for the rest is cheaper than a
# context that breaks when a path moves.
target/
**/target/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.devenv*
.direnv/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
